find: Component::CurDir => {}
replace: Component::CurDir => kept.push("."),
caught-by:
    apply::tests::one_file_spelt_two_ways_is_one_file_of_the_plan

[break] apply-a-deleted-file-comes-back-without-its-permissions
rule: A file the script deleted comes back, when a check fails, with the permissions it had.
